00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:54.850
Even if they tell you to get lost, how far can you go?

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:06.900
The last time I was on a cruise ship, the captain had a parrot on her shoulder with an eyepatch.

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:10.290
It's the only time I ever saw a parrot with an eyepatch.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:19.660
